# https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001004
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001004> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.org/spar/doco/Paragraph> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001011> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a doco:Paragraph to the\n        viewsari:page_web_representation instance that corresponds to\n        the first printed page on which the paragraph begins. For\n        paragraphs confined to a single page this property and\n        viewsari:hasEndPage resolve to the same individual. The range\n        is intentionally set to the manifestation level (page web\n        representation) rather than the expression level (page), because\n        physical page extent is a property of the embodied digital text,\n        not of the abstract intellectual content." .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001004> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has start page"@en .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001004> <http://www.w3.org/2008/05/skos#example> "viewsari:the_lives_1568_volume-1_paragraph-1\n        viewsari:hasStartPage viewsari:the_lives_1568_gutenberg_web_version_of_volume-1_cimabue-bio_page_3 ." .
# 
# https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001005
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001005> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.org/spar/doco/Paragraph> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001011> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a doco:Paragraph to the\n        viewsari:page_web_representation instance that corresponds to\n        the last printed page on which the paragraph ends. For\n        paragraphs confined to a single page this property and\n        viewsari:hasStartPage resolve to the same individual. Across all\n        ten volumes of the Du Vere translation, 48.2% of paragraphs\n        span more than one printed page, making this property necessary\n        to faithfully represent the physical extent of each\n        passage." .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001005> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has end page"@en .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001005> <http://www.w3.org/2008/05/skos#example> "viewsari:the_lives_1568_volume-1_paragraph-1\n        viewsari:hasEndPage\n        viewsari:the_lives_1568_gutenberg_web_version_of_volume-1_cimabue-bio_page_4 ." .
# 
# https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001030
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001030> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001030> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#relatedEndeavour> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001030> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001036> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001030> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001001> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001030> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001000> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001030> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Records the derivation relationship\n        between a viewsari:translation and the viewsari:edition from\n        which it was made. This property is a subproperty of\n        frbr:relatedEndeavour and specialises it for the specific\n        case of a translation deriving from an edition of the same\n        work. In the Viewsari knowledge graph, the Du Vere English\n        translation (the_lives_1568) is based on the 1568 Giunti\n        Italian edition (le_vite_1568)." .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001030> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is based on"@en .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001030> <http://www.w3.org/2008/05/skos#example> "viewsari:the_lives_1568\n        viewsari:isBasedOn viewsari:le_vite_1568 ." .
# 
# https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001032
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001032> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/relation> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001033> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.org/spar/doco/Paragraph> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Anchors a viewsari:extracted_content\n        individual — most commonly a viewsari:cooccurrence — to the\n        doco:Paragraph in which the co-occurring surface forms appear.\n        This property provides the primary provenance link between the\n        content layer and the structural layer and is the key predicate\n        for source-text queries such as \"retrieve all co-occurrences\n        attested in paragraph X\". The subproperty relationship to\n        dct:relation is intentional: the paragraph is the relational\n        context, not a part-of relationship." .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "in paragraph"@en .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001032> <http://www.w3.org/2008/05/skos#example> "viewsari:cooccurrence_cim-gio_1\n        viewsari:inParagraph\n        viewsari:the_lives_1568_volume-1_paragraph-13 ." .
# 
# https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001034
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001034> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001034> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/relation> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001034> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "involves"@en .
# 
# https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001035
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001035> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/relation> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001018> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001026> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a coreferent mention to the antecedent\n       mention (explicit or implicit) to which it co-refers within\n       the same biography. The antecedent must lie within the current\n       biography; cross-biography coreference is not represented." .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "refers to"@en .
# 
# https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001036
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001036> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001036> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#relatedEndeavour> .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001036> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is basis of" .
