<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The abstract intellectual work\n        Le Vite de' più eccellenti pittori, scultori, e architettori by\n        Giorgio Vasari. This individual represents the work in the FRBR\n        sense — the abstract conception independent of any specific\n        edition, translation, or physical carrier. The Wikidata item\n        Q1645493 is the external authority record for this\n        work." .
