<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001028> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The 1568 Giunti (Giuntina) edition of\n        Le Vite, published in Florence by the Giunti press. This is the\n        canonical edition of The Lives, substantially expanded and\n        revised relative to the first 1550 Torrentiniana edition, and\n        is the source text on which the Du Vere English translation\n        (viewsari:the_lives_1568) is based. All volume, biography,\n        page, and paragraph instances in the Viewsari knowledge graph\n        ultimately trace their editorial provenance to this\n        edition." .
<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001028> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Le vite de' piu eccellenti pittori, scultori, e architettori"@it .
