<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001029> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The 1912 English translation of Le Vite\n        by Gaston C. du Vere, published in ten volumes by Macmillan and\n        the Medici Society (London, 1912–1914). This is the primary\n        source text for all extraction and annotation in the Viewsari\n        project. The translation follows the 1568 Giunti edition closely\n        and is the version digitised by Project Gutenberg (EBook series\n        starting at #25326). It is the parent of all ten\n        viewsari:volume individuals in the knowledge\n        graph." .
