<https://viewsari.ise.fiz-karlsruhe.de/ontology/#0001031> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Project Gutenberg web publication\n        of the Du Vere translation, comprising ten separate HTML files\n        (one per volume). This individual represents the collection as a\n        whole; each volume web representation links to it via\n        frbr:isPartOf. The HTML files embed printed page markers as\n        #Page_N anchors, which are the targets of all rdfs:seeAlso\n        links on page and biography web representation instances.\n        The Gutenberg release was produced from images provided by the\n        Internet Archive / Canadian Libraries and encoded in\n        ISO-8859-1." .
